    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385840/extras/title_raw_small.png?t=1614681155\" /></div><br><strong>Cube Worlds Survival</strong> is an epic shooter RPG game with voxel style and endless gameplay.<br>Fight with various enemies, collect resources, upgrade your stats and weapons, unlock and explore different worlds but what\u2019s the most important - try to survive! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385840/extras/dcb0d8d97a659935da1266c4e617e0ac.webp?t=1614681155\" /></div><strong>FULLY DESTRUCTIBLE WORLD</strong><br>You have an enormous tools of destruction. Kill enemies with precise headshots or destroy them with tress and ground in large explosions. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385840/extras/c70465d3e288b2f0e3d8033f7494080e.webp?t=1614681155\" /></div><strong>DOZENS OF WEAPONS</strong><br>Pistols, rifles, shotguns, rocket launchers - everything you can even imagine! Every weapon has a unique look and stats. Chose your perfect tool!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385840/extras/265cac002f7db9b5f91e0e15dcb67c28.webp?t=1614681155\" /></div><strong>EVERYTHING IS UPGRADABLE</strong><br>Upgrade all stats from health to weapons damage. A lot of passive perks. Unlock super expensive abilities that can make you truly invincible!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385840/extras/59c7a3c7519bc140eff21e7d872b1de1.webp?t=1614681155\" /></div><strong>DIFFERENT WORLDS</strong><br>Travel across 12 different worlds with various difficulty and reward settings. From peaceful forests to real hell where you\u2019ll be dead in seconds.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385840/extras/169a0df62b638863b6f2c315b7f05bef.webp?t=1614681155\" /></div><strong>TOUGH ENEMIES</strong><br>These guys won\u2019t let you relax even for a second. Buy new guns and upgrades regularly to increase your chances fighting against them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385840/extras/5fb2fad7a1c8d3aca6a1cf4f805b4758.webp?t=1614681155\" /></div><strong>ENDLESS GAMEPLAY</strong><br>Feel yourself like a superhero killing enemies by hundreds? Then start a new game with insane difficulty boost. This time you won\u2019t survive!",
